WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.500
12:00 — Log cheap eat. Between classes Noor logs a budget eat on her phone — cheap and good can both be true, and now it is written down.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:17.000
12:20 — Wishlist. Wishlist collects spots under her ceiling so Friday is not a coin-flip between expensive and regrettable.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:25.500
17:00 — Map. Map on the phone pins the honest places; she stops relying on a mental map that forgets after exams.

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:34.000
21:00 — Journal. Journal entry captures what she ordered and what she would skip — future Noor will thank her.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:42.500
21:20 — Seasonal. Seasonal note for mango season. Budget list stays honest. Fictional sample data throughout.

